      "value": "@{5ae033b54dffca63ae74caa0|full_name}: It means that we looked at the idea, liked it, but there's other bug fixes we are prioritizing that are higher priority. Looking at the colors for the User Status also prompted some discussion on other UI color choices, which may mean deeper design choices/changes that require more of a time investment.\n\nIn short, this is a Good Idea, and we'll probably act on it in the future-- but not at this very moment.",
