      "statusChangeID": "5b6b5d7f315b254b4aee1ac3",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "in progress",
      "value": "We're swapping around the colors a bit. The border idea is good, we plan on revisiting that in the future. For now the light-blue color is \"JOIN ME\", and green is \"ACTIVE\"-- the default state. \n\nBusy (red) and Offline (gray) has also been dulled out a bit to make it more clear that they don't want you to join (or you can't join on them, because.. well, they're offline )\n\nThis may change slightly before Beta goes to Live, and of course is subject to further change in the future. Keep in mind our UI is far from final.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
