      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The entire UI is going to get a makeover in the near future so don't want to spend much time noodling on art. For me (and the team) the menu UI is still pretty temporary. For the moment it was a case of put in a quick colored dot or don't get the user status feature in. We're aware of color blindness issues and will run the final colors through a colorblind test to check 'em. There's logistics reasons why they might not make it to be icons at this point. The UI scene is locked for a release. See what we can do but might be dots for this release and updated in a next one. Def thanks for all the detailed feedback. It is always welcomed and helpful.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
